  "description": "This work is a collection of short stories consisting of several episodes. \n\nThe hotter night of the Poisonous Snakes vs. the White Tigers. Want to see the thrilling and secretive adult BL short stories of gangster brothers? If you're handsome, go to GAYNG! \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated, edited) \n\n1.**Viper** (독사) \\[Anco x Mongya\\]\n2.**Jopokdo Toesaga Doenayo?** (조폭도 퇴사가 되나요?) \\[Baekgong\\]\n3. **Santa** (산타) \\[Yang-Sin Tae\\]\n4.**Baesinui Muge** (배신의 무게) \\[Cheok Kong\\]\n5. **Eomnaijing** (업라이징) \\[Sup\\]",
